                "comment": "Class itself wasn't easy but he's funny and makes lectures bearable. Fair tests imo if you go to class and study well. Attendance is not taken but definitely necessary to do well in the course. Very nice guy, only thing is he does talk quite fast and go through lectures fast. ",
                "difficulty_rating": 4,
                "quality_rating": 5
            },
            {
                "comment": "Dr. Jorgenson is my absolute favorite professor. The course itself was difficult, but he makes it as easy to understand as possible and is very knowledgeable. His study guides and review lectures are helpful and he grades his exams fairly, often giving points back. He is a super likable and funny guy which makes his lectures interesting. \n",
                "difficulty_rating": 3,
                "quality_rating": 5
